            "review_text": "WillMS777\nChatel, France137 contributions\n0\nStill amazing\nDec 2017 • Couples\nVe actually written at oeast 2 previous reviews - as I return here so frequently I believe it is still fair to review again...\n\nThis restaurant is increasing in popilarity yet the food is consistently excellent. The owners are often overwhelmed by the popularity which shows their humble approach to hospitality. Yet food items have never ran out which i am increasingly amazed by. \n\nWe essentially have 2 of our weekly meals from this establishment. Locals love it. Foreignors too. I really cant recommend this place highly enough for its tasty cuisine in famile-esque, hunble setting.\nRead more\nWritten February 3, 2018",
