            "review_text": "tsouthgate22\nBristol, United Kingdom3 contributions\n0\nA taste of heaven\nOct 2017 • Friends\nI regularly ate at Sesame over a 4 month period of living in Hanoi. The set menu for one is a daily rotating option boasting pure health and vegan vibes. These alongside the nutritious spring rolls and their mouth watering smoothies put Sesame in a league of its own in a city where it is hard to find anything as fresh and delicious.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 1, 2017",
