            "review_text": "Debboui\nBirmingham, United Kingdom16 contributions\n0\nOur favourite\nAug 2017 • Couples\nMy husband and I come here weekly for delicious, healthy, fresh and non-clichéd Vietnamese food. We bring boxes to take away (I hope that is not too annoying and that they don't mind!). It has simple yet clean interior and a co-owner speaks excellent English. \n\nMy feeling is this is not a £££ sign place - just a £-££. Cannot recommend highly\n\n(Finally the review below suggesting they use fish sauce/stock etc is untrue. We were once showed how they make 'bun dau' - a traditional dish that usually uses a potent shrimp paste. I felt the same but she was very proud to teach me how she makes the dish. Of course I could be wrong but having gone here weekly for 3 years I am pretty darn confident)\n.\nRead more\nWritten August 19, 2017",
            "rating": 5.0,
