            "review_title": "Review at Sesame",
            "review_text": "Murray F\nVancouver, Canada186 contributions\n0\nVery good vegetarian vegan restaurant.\nMay 2017 • Friends\nThis is a very good vegetarian restaurant in the Tay Ho area of Hanoi; a major ex pat area of Hanoi. \nIt is relatively small, but the food is very good. Although it may be slow at times, it is a friendly family run restaurant. The mustard leaf spring rolls are an original and are very good. The pumpkin green pea soup may be a bit bland for some tastes, but everything else is very good. I also like their sweet and sour banana blossom salad. Prices are very reasonable for the area. Most of their tofu dishes are quite good. Check it out if you are in the area or don't mind traveling a bit in Hanoi to try some very good vegetarian food.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 2, 2017",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
