            "review_text": "Chris D\nHanoi, Vietnam19 contributions\n0\nAmazing vegetarian food\nApr 2017 • Friends\nThis place should be a lot busier and more popular than it currently is. The food is incredible and has really opened my eyes to vegetarian cuisine. Be prepared for a somewhat lengthy wait at times - everything is prepared fresh and so can take some time - just bring a book and be prepared to chill out and wait for a bit. Highlights include the mustard spring rolls, avocado smoothie and the set menu. They have the best tofu I have ever had. Very friendly owner too who speaks excellent English. Can't wait to go back!\nRead more\nWritten April 13, 2017",
