            "review_text": "Kelly R\n5 contributions\n0\nBEST VEGAN FOOD IN HANOI!\nFeb 2017 • Couples\nI LOVE THIS PLACE. The food is so delicious and the owners are so sweet. The main owner speaks perfect English and you can tell she enjoys what she does. The food is delicious. If it wasn't a little on the pricey side I would eat here everyday. \n\nMy favorite is the bun dau (fried tofu, noodles, herbs and a dipping sauce that I am addicted to), the mustard leaf spring rolls and the soups are delicious. I also regularly buy her homemade peanut butter because it isn't processed and filled with sugar. \n\nThe only complaint I have is that they aren't opened enough. I don't know the exact hours but we have been a few times during lunch time on a couple occasions and they have been closed. \n\nPlease support this business and their amazing vegan food!!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 19, 2017",
