            "review_text": "Bridget B\nHanoi, Vietnam2 contributions\n0\nBest Spring Rolls Ever\nNov 2016 • Solo\nYou can't beat a set lunch for 60,000d made from scratch upon order. I highly recommend the cabbage spring rolls. You can taste the great love and care she puts into her dishes by using fresh, local ingredients. The place itself is tucked away in a quiet alley which makes for a relaxing lunch. I would recommend calling ahead (0462934107) to place your order. If I leave Hanoi knowing anything, it will be how to make Sesame's spring rolls.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 4, 2016",
